# Checks before handoff

- Run the smallest relevant test while iterating.
- Before handing off code, run `pnpm check`; if a check cannot run, report the exact command and reason.
- For runtime/bootstrap changes, also run `pnpm build` and smoke-test the built server or use Fastify
  injection.
- For changes under `ai/rules/` or `ai/skills/`, run `pnpm sync:agents` before `pnpm audit:agents`.
- Never weaken lint, type, test, or audit configuration merely to make a failing check pass.
